  "title": "TotalEnergies proposes a dividend of 3.22 €/share for fiscal year 2024, a 7% increase",
  "summary": "Paris, 5th February 2025 – The Board of Directors met on February 4, 2025, and decided to propose at the Shareholders’ Meeting on May 23, 2025, the distribution of a dividend of 3.22 €/share for fiscal year 2024, a 7% increase compared to the dividend for fiscal year 2023 of 3.01 €/share. This increase is […]",
